{
  "name": "05_platformer",
  "description": "Build a playable platformer for the Craft engine: a player who runs right (input direction), can jump (input action), lands on solid tiles, and wins by touching the goal node. The win is recorded by setting the player node's `won` component to true (e.g. via a Lua on_signal handler for the physics `collide` signal whose payload is {a, b}).",
  "seed": 7,
  "ticks": 300,
